                            	  8289: ; Description:
                            	  8290: ; Blue Wizzrobe has two states: walking and teleporting.
                            	  8291: ; When walking, the object timer is set. When teleporting,
                            	  8292: ; the teleporting distance remaining is set.
                            	  8293: ;
                            	  8294: ; If we have the magic clock, then only go draw and check collisions.
                            	  8295: ;
                            	  8296:     even
                            	  8297: UpdateBlueWizzrobe:
02:0003D462 102C066C        	  8298:     move.b  ($066C,A4),D0
