                            	 10868: ; Description:
                            	 10869: ; This block applies to heads and the bottom segment of a neck.
                            	 10870: ; These are drawn with sprites that come first in order, so that
                            	 10871: ; they are drawn above all other sprites, including Link.
                            	 10872: ;
                            	 10873: ; Params:
                            	 10874: ; A: tile number
                            	 10875: ;
