                            	  9386:     ; Look up the item for this room, and store it.
                            	  9387:     ; If it's item ID 3, then deactivate the object.
                            	  9388:     ;
                            	  9389:     ; Item ID 3 normally means the master sword. But because the
                            	  9390:     ; usual value meaning "no item" ($3F) can't fit in the level
                            	  9391:     ; block attribute for a room item (up to $1F); use 3 to
                            	  9392:     ; stand in for it.
                            	  9393:     ;
